{
  "id": "unique-event-019",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#19 - climbing the tree\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,624,648]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Rosen family used this tree to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,648,683]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hang the children. It looks like they\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,683,721]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sacrificed them to some\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,721,745]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "unnamable entity. You climb the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,745,777]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "tree and find a tree house that the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,777,813]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Rosens had built to attract their\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,813,847]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "victims.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,847,856]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you enter the tree house, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,856,889]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disturb a large owl that flies past\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,889,925]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you, startling you. Make a L3 agility\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,925,963]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Save, at +1 if you are Agile. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,963,1000]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fail, you fall from the tree and take\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1000,1038]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 damage or the Limping injury\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1038,1069]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from the Injuries table (your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1069,1099]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "choice, but if you already have the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1099,1135]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Limping Injury, you must take the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1135,1169]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life damage).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1169,1183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you fall, you may climb back\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1183,1215]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "again.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1215,1222]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Inside the tree house, you find\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1222,1254]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stacks of old magazines and a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1254,1284]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "journal. It seems the Rosens had\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1284,1317]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "discovered a cult of children\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1317,1347]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "witches. The Rosens apparently\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1347,1378]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "belonged to a rival cult and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1378,1407]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "sacrificed seven of the young\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1407,1437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "witches by hanging them from this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1437,1471]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "walnut tree. A  girl was given to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1471,1507]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-019:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "certain “Pigface”. Gain 1 Clue.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[84,1507,1539]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    84
  ]
}
